      3 
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">نابأهُ</span></b>  <i>He acquainted</i> or <i>informed him, and
the latter did the same.</i> (K.) ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b2-  Also, simply,
<i>He acquainted</i> or <i>informed him.</i> (TA.) ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b3-  <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">نَابَأَهُمْ</span>
<i>He quitted their neighbourhood; withdrew to a
distance from them.</i> (K.) [See also art. <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">نبو</span>.]

